1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
ProofStudio creates durable, verifiable generative media.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A single application connects structured creative direction, generation, storage, and verification.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The campaign brief captures audience, message, tone, constraints, and aspect ratio as structured input.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Live Mode restores durable run history from private Backblaze B2 after deployment restarts.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:56,000
This public run generated two landscape variants with Cloudflare Workers AI and stored both originals in B2.

6
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Genblaze records the exact model, prompt, parameters, provider request IDs, asset hashes, and canonical manifest hash.

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Verification downloads the stored manifest and assets, then recomputes every SHA-256 hash.

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Two images. One canonical manifest. Verifiable after restart.
